Capri Desktop, recoded by balaqiang (https://github.com/balaqiang/capri-desktop)

This project is a recode of capri-desktop by mochiiwuff (https://github.com/mochiiwuff/capri-desktop),
starting from its version 0.4.4, with features ported from Capri Desktop 2.4 (C#), itself started from
lachydotmcg/capri-desktop (https://github.com/lachydotmcg/capri-desktop).

What is under which license:

- The original capri-desktop code by mochiiwuff is licensed under the PolyForm Noncommercial License 1.0.0.
  Its full terms, exactly as published with it, are in LICENSES/capri-desktop.md
  (https://github.com/mochiiwuff/capri-desktop/blob/main/LICENSE). The code that came from its versions up to
  0.4.3 keeps its MIT notice ("Copyright (c) 2026 Capri Desktop contributors"), at the end of that file.

- The changes and additions made in this repository by balaqiang are licensed under the MIT License below.

- This project contains the original code, so the project as a whole may only be used, changed and shared
  under the PolyForm Noncommercial terms: for free, never for sale. balaqiang's own additions, taken on their
  own, may be used under the MIT License.

- The character artwork (assets/capri/, assets/art/, docs/) is not covered by any of these licenses. Capri,
